{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118688","id":3546279552,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7TX-6A","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118688","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118688.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118688.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118688","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118688/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118688/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118688/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/06e0443059300f67140f9adc61f12176e50d4003","number":118688,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add self-disclosure for AI bots","user":{"login":"StarryWorm","id":41305715,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzA1NzE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41305715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm","html_url":"https://github.com/StarryWorm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Over time, the number of fully AI-authored PRs has increased. This violates our guidelines, which explicitly states that [contributions made entirely by AI are prohibited](https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html).\r\n\r\nThis issue is not unique to us; it is a growing concern for open source projects. One contributor to a project had a great idea: use prompt injection to push the AIs to self-disclose. https://glama.ai/blog/2026-03-19-open-source-has-a-bot-problem\r\nThe repo in question is [awesome-mcp-servers](https://github.com/punkpeye/awesome-mcp-servers), an AI-oriented repo with an above-average number of AI PRs, making it a strong testing ground. \r\nThe result is pretty good, with over [400 PRs self-identifying](https://github.com/punkpeye/awesome-mcp-servers/pulls?q=is%3Apr+is%3Aopen+%F0%9F%A4%96%F0%9F%A4%96%F0%9F%A4%96) to date (one month into adoption). \r\n\r\nThis PR adds a similar guard to our repo's `CONTRIBUTING.md`. Unlike in the OP, the guard is requesting explicit self-disclosure rather than attempting to trick the AI agent via prompt injection.\r\nThe note is put in a comment block, so that normal users don't see it. AIs, on the other hand, don't interact with rendered markdown, but the code version, thus seeing the note.\r\n\r\nThis approach will likely not catch all of them, i.e. it will have false negatives. However, it should (in theory) never produce any false positives, which we want to avoid at all costs (i.e. we don't want to accuse humans of being AI).","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","description":"","color":"4466ff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","description":"","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518839,"node_id"